<title>UK: Muenchener Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Muenchener Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MUENCHENER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.125    MATURITY    15.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.97    PAY DATE    15.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN     MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEAR ONE, STEPS UP TO 4.75 PCT YEAR TWO, 5.0</p>
<p>		 PCT YEAR THREE, 5.25 PCT YEAR FOUR AND 6.0 PCT YEAR</p>
<p>		 FIVE</p>
<p>		 PFANDBRIEF 288</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
